   383	    """Flood paint through aligned box gaps, filling each downstream hollow rectangle and the straight pipe segments between them.
   384	
   385	    Input structure:
   386	    - Black background with several one-cell-thick hollow rectangles whose borders have one or two single-cell gaps.
